OL,5,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FIn Townsville, Queensland,
OL,7,     Flong-distance trucker Peter gets
OL,8,     Fset for a cross-country haul. He
OL,9,     Fhas to move this mixed freight
OL,10,     Fthrough bush, farmland and desert
OL,11,     Fto Darwin.
OL,12,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,13,     FIn Wales, haulier Ian gears
OL,14,     Fhimself up for a major
OL,15,     Fcross-country mega-move that
OL,16,     Frequires a police escort. And in
OL,17,     FHull, mega mover Steve is in
OL,18,     Fcharge of shifting a 38-tonne
OL,19,     Fscreener.
